 class="btn" type="submit" data-confirm="Sostituire il file mantenendo tutti i collegamenti esistenti?">Sostituisci</button></form></details><form action="/idemaclima/admin/media/archive" method="post" data-confirm="Archiviare questo file?"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($csrf,ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8') ?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$a['id'] ?>"><button class="btn danger" type="submit" <?= (int)$a['usage_count']>0?'disabled title="File attualmente utilizzato"':'' ?>>Archivia</button></form></div></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div>
